<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate.ejs") %>

<div class="container my-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12">
      <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 p-4 p-md-5">
        <h1 class="mb-3 fw-bold atithi-red">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">Last Updated: September 2026</p>

        <p class="lead">
          Welcome to <strong>Atithi</strong>. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal data you share with us while discovering and hosting authentic cultural homestays.
        </p>

        <hr class="my-4" />

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h4 class="fw-semibold">1. Information We Collect</h4>
          <p>When you register, create listings, or interact with our platform, we collect:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Account Details:</strong> Your username, email address, and authentication credentials managed securely via encrypted sessions.</li>
            <li><strong>Listing Information:</strong> Titles, descriptions, nightly prices, location details, and geographical coordinates.</li>
            <li><strong>Media Uploads:</strong> Images uploaded for homestay listings, which are stored and processed via third-party cloud storage.</li>
            <li><strong>Reviews & Feedback:</strong> Ratings and textual reviews you post on community listings.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h4 class="fw-semibold">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
          <p>We use your information to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Facilitate listing creation, display, and homestay management.</li>
            <li>Render accurate interactive location maps on homestay detail pages.</li>
            <li>Maintain active user sessions and secure account authentication.</li>
            <li>Prevent fraudulent activity and maintain community safety.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h4 class="fw-semibold">3. Third-Party Integrations</h4>
          <p>To provide core application features, Atithi integrates with verified third-party service providers:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Cloudinary:</strong> Hosts and serves listing photographs securely.</li>
            <li><strong>Mapbox:</strong> Converts location addresses into geographic coordinates and renders interactive maps.</li>
            <li><strong>MongoDB Atlas:</strong> Securely hosts encrypted production databases in cloud infrastructure.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small text-muted">
            These external services adhere to their respective privacy standards and only receive data strictly necessary to fulfill these features.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h4 class="fw-semibold">4. Cookies and Session Storage</h4>
          <p>
            Atithi uses secure HTTP cookies to manage user login states, flash notification banners, and session persistence across page reloads. We do not use persistent tracking cookies for third-party behavioral advertising.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h4 class="fw-semibold">5. Data Retention & Deletion</h4>
          <p>
            You have the right to modify or delete listings you own at any time using the dashboard controls. When a listing is removed, associated reviews and media references are permanently purged from our active database.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
          <h4 class="fw-semibold">6. Contact Us</h4>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal data on Atithi, please reach out via our support channel or open an issue on our official GitHub repository.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
          <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-search">&larr; Back to Listings</a>
          <span class="text-muted small">&copy; 2026 Atithi. All rights reserved.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>